From 0453369a639cd4b2b993b18d68e8a53acabf91e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x1xhlol <lucknitelol@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:20:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] wasm: Add SIMD128 pixel functions

sad, sad_x3/x4, ssd, satd, satd_x3/x4, sa8d, var, var2, hadamard_ac,
the SSIM helpers and the intra mode cost functions, 8-bit only. All of
them are bit-exact with the C versions, including ssim_end4, which
does the same float operations in the same order.

The SATD, SA8D and hadamard_ac transforms leave out their last
butterfly stage and use |a+b| + |a-b| = 2*max(|a|,|b|) instead.
---
